<title>USA: US spot MTBE firmer amid a tick up in demand.</title>
<headline>US spot MTBE firmer amid a tick up in demand.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cts/Gallon  Prompt(Feb)	Any (Mar)	 02/13/97(PptFeb)</p>
<p>Houston     78.50/79.50	80.00/80.75     77.25/78.00</p>
<p>New York    82.50/83.50	82.25/83.00 N   82.00/82.50</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Spot MTBE prices were firmer in light activity this week as buyers returned to the market after a long absence, players said on Thursday.</p>
<p>For the past few weeks, buyers have been reluctant to buy barrels in anticipation of ever lower numbers in a market weighed down by too much supply of the gasoline additive.</p>
<p>Trade, however, was slow due to an industry conference.</p>
